{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "game": "hsr",
  "id": "adventures-of-the-rosy-celestial-maiden",
  "name": "Adventures of the Rosy Celestial Maiden",
  "sourceUrl": "https://honkai-star-rail.fandom.com/wiki/Adventures_of_the_Rosy_Celestial_Maiden",
  "scrapedAt": "2026-08-11T16:01:26.129Z",
  "volumes": [
    {
      "id": "1",
      "volumeKey": "text",
      "label": "Text",
      "document": {
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Looks like I've got a grasp on what's going on,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I didn't physically enter this world."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I might just be a ghost,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "A ghost named \"Rosy Celestial Maiden,\""
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "...hope I don't scare anyone."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-db6c10981c5f8b67"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "These days, no one can see me directly,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "and I can't meddle in anything either."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Just like a \"memetic\" entity Black Swan was talking about,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "but I must have left some traces behind, right?"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "...Otherwise, who do they think they're talking about when they mention the \"Rosy Celestial Maiden\"?"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-3d0434e64bd37a44"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I remembered the day I ran into that red-haired girl."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "She was praying in a secret chamber:"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "\"I have accepted the mission. I have to set out...\""
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Surely, it must have been something very important,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "\"Mom... see you tomorrow.\""
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Just going with my gut, I followed after her."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Sure enough, she was stopped by unreasonable guards."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-51629dba431e0910"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "But what can someone like me possibly do?"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "... I want to help her on her journey more than anything."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Just stand by and watch? Not a chance!"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Hey, even \"memetic entities\" have our own special talents!"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I could be her shield! Or maybe her spear!"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Heck, I could even be a crumbled pillar..."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-b5a15bd9efa4bbef"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "\"Is the Titan... on her side?\""
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Ha! Wrong answer! It's ME who's on her side!"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "...If only I could actually show up in front of her."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Just imagine how much more I could do for her."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-e176d800e2333df9"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "\"Finally... beyond this gate awaits a boundless world.\""
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "\"This is where my journey begins.\""
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "She made it."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "But as a memetic entity... I'm completely worn out."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "...When I came to, I was somewhere totally different."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-74aa913487b2440b"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "\"She won't remember you. You won't leave a trace in anyone's memories...\""
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I think I heard another me speaking."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Am I going crazy?"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I should be fine! I can't even imagine what it'd be like if I actually lost my marbles..."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-88dba4542c55fc58"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "But hey, I totally left a trace."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "She might not remember me, but she successfully started her journey now."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "That \"rather illogical outcome\" on the day her journey began was my mark."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Just like the Rosy Celestial Maiden."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Amphoreus might not remember me, but the legend of the Rosy Celestial Maiden is everywhere in this land."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-82701ed73eb2163d"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I'm not throwing in the towel yet."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Someday, everyone in Amphoreus will know exactly who the Rosy Celestial Maiden really is!"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-b66ba3b847551388"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
